File name: GN5WLOOP.MP
Path description: Gnoll Encampment, very easy loop.
Path starts: Gnoll Encampment, 5 way room.
Path ends: ---
Area of the game: Module 1
Level recommendation: 15-25
Type of path: Loop
File format: New
Monsters encountered: gnoll, gnoll axeman, gnoll scout.
Additional information:

This loop avoids the gnoll chieftain, and the guard post.

Included in the zip are BOATFORK.MP, SILVGN5W.MP, GN5WSILV.MP, SILVFORK.MP
and FORKBOAT.MP which are paths to and from the start of this loop, via the
silvery river.

